{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies a retention rule for records of the society. Records are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute [[cite:obs-216f877f109093f7a26fed1358f7faa383672994 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]].\n\nThe statute's retention rule is that records of the society are kept according to the schedule specified within the statute itself [[cite:obs-216f877f109093f7a26fed1358f7faa383672994 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]].\n\nThe statute does not specify the exact duration in this source, only that the retention period is named in the schedule of the statute [[cite:obs-216f877f109093f7a26fed1358f7faa383672994 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"83fa46a141af5582aa3ff1eaeebcd1d2bd7c958e93b4c5f22fa55c1e78d750f6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added clear statements about the statute's retention rule and the duration of record retention as specified in the schedule, each supported by exact citations from the source obs-216f877f109093f7a26fed1358f7faa383672994. No unsupported duration was added."}